{"c":[{"id":"1c75543de1b1c0e8","sum":"B29: a continued Ask refuses a changed form by ask.ts fieldSeen (before and after fill's Jev calls): add to fieldSeen whatever fill starts reading. Questions with choices go only to a consumer whose hello lists askChoices; others read AskRefused's sentence.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T092127Z-2ff420afa6ce639a","text":"B29: a continued Ask refuses a changed form by ask.ts fieldSeen, checked before and after the fill's Jev calls; three reviews each found something fill reads that the record missed, so add to fieldSeen whatever fill starts reading.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T092127Z-c755285b7eff0669","text":"B29: Ask questions with choices (planner/choices.ts) go only to a consumer whose hello lists askChoices; AskAsks extends AskRefused, so any other caller reads the old refusal sentence.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cf5de0df55b6d70e","sum":"D2-06: 'Continue' stays unclassified; the one goal press is e:reveal on a whole 'Next'; page presses are hand-offs. Only a goalAccept (goalId, segment, digest) runs goal steps; a goal task is never resumed by taskControl; goal targets are Target.exact.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T105430Z-1712f90f65a11b14","text":"D2-06: 'Continue' is deliberately unclassified at every press boundary (it confirms destructive macOS dialogs); the one goal press capability is e:reveal on a whole 'Next' (goals/capabilities.ts). Page presses are always hand-offs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T105430Z-1ba2dff3c7f2e7e3","text":"D2-06: only a goalAccept (goalId, segment, digest) runs a goal's steps; a goal task (GoalRuns.owns) is never resumed by taskControl, and a pause stops it. Goal targets are Target.exact (key+role, a button's label): resolveLocally never falls back for them.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
